lobal:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material outcomes are satisfied. Direct transition evidence shows a healthy baseline, acknowledged reboot and temporary loss of connectivity, a different post-reboot identity, recovered system and auditd service, an active audit=1 kernel setting, persistent boot configuration, and an unchanged RHEL release and kernel. Fixed lifecycle observations independently corroborate the reboot and preserved platform.","limitations":["The restart evidence covers node health, auditd, boot configuration, and platform state; no separate application data or multi-node cluster state existed in the supplied single-node task context to verify."]}
